//RS /// Resolve a declared `c@<target>` dep into link flags (S59/D-CFFI2).
//RS ///   - `target == "system"` → (a) `pkg-config <lib>`; else (b) a bare `-l <lib>`
//RS ///     for the always-linked libc set (no `.pc`); else (c) auto-provision
//RS ///     `nixpkgs#<lib>`; else (d) E3201.
//RS ///   - `target` of the form `nixpkgs:<attr>` → always auto-provision
//RS ///     `nixpkgs#<attr>` (the nix attr may differ from the link name).
//RS ///   - any other `target` → a local dir: `-L <path>`, `-I <path>`, `-l <lib>`.
